 "1055531599147625", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974713_1055531602480958_3299547534509325263_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TZmuZ80fs2YQ7kNvwE_94w3&_nc_oc=AdrNvv0UJlqROrfPpSEMDGyOI3o9GWLPclYMkV069eQLV0ywj79vX7y5Xv2tFBUWB74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDFzqJMNEd9bWF3oX46hMPxv-cQTUdXIGZBdaUnV0hOqg&oe=6A5B711E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "683511393314653", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036684_683511396647986_3047485570719539906_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l5LlWLQqJtkQ7kNvwE_ZZli&_nc_oc=AdrauGMqwOcJ26ZWbCUBtqGTRlO0Dv0AoDL1ZCW7affInCFgyp5HXhQxtt4pTIdxlU8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDiX7HywAT1GXT8Z4MafepAUIiyE3tzfNIJxarnlhn4Sg&oe=6A5B8EC1"}, {"file_name": "HORIZONTAL_COMP_3 (0-00-33-54).png", "id": "1458793048299052", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035383_1458793051632385_6201125288883864638_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aV7YSCxBWcgQ7kNvwHU8KMf&_nc_oc=Adqbzug-ezsGhT3n72sGOOjn1QfQ3I7xKIswZ8KNTfkvsuc-7ojcIbKD-Q2oL0bb188&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBYmNT0c_hqorB23fiNM4RiPaVbb4jij1Jh62KgeKAerQ&oe=6A5B6B7E"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "827134765720718", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982592_827134769054051_8012892633401113797_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3nwes080ukgQ7kNvwE2vpNB&_nc_oc=AdrOowMGpaOZUbhOHckpWRFB1jjtcS4pDve6wjmiRxcBtZEnC1fe_wH9vD2wgmGWQlw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC2mICr6VBV0NPafbH3g9-zfI2u6Qvf_m92gjF4DHR7Ag&oe=6A5B6FA3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SaberCity_Trailer_Thumbnail_1.png", "id": "117461424774283", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75639796_117461428107616_4506053201965282111_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zvDs_N84RaMQ7kNvwG7IRBn&_nc_oc=AdoR572ZJ-IRF9WZWpq4iuJm02hg7V4_qLRmeKXnxoiAOILnkLR7xiCY8QRYFxrFTdY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC4QTf5p0TCcsIaTGrlelb-ND8Ff3904G4WYnzOS4oa2Q&oe=6A5B75BB"}, "display_name": "Saber City", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Saber City is a 2-player co-located dueling game for Meta Quest. 2 players can link their headsets in the same physical space and battle with melee and ranged weapons. Saber City features mixed reality gameplay, so you and a friend can see each other in the real world ,via the Oculus Quest\u2019s cameras, and battle in AR.\n\n***NOTE:  Saber City is a multiplayer game and requires 2 Meta Quest headsets to play.\n\nIMPORTANT: Please maintain at least 3 feet distance between yourself and the other player. Be aware of your surroundings. Do not run with the headset on.\n\nYou can choose from 4 different character battle kits with unique weapons to wield in mixed reality. The current version of Saber City includes support for Meta Quest Pro and Quest 3.\n\nBattle Kits:\n\nCOWBORG - Cyber cowboy with cattle prod and shotgun\n\nSKYLORD - Hammer wielding warrior from beyond\n\nSKULL CZAR - Possessing dark energy sword and magic bow\n\nSABER SENTINAL - AR soldier with saber and pistol\n\nFor questions and feedback please join the Saber City Discord server: https://discord.gg/EhuQSbNeYV\n\nor contact via email: contact@yarwad.com\n\n", "short_description": "Saber City is a 2 player shared-space dueling game where players battle for supremacy in mixed-reality"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercityprivacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yarwad Publishing Empire", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.yarwad.com/sabercity", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "con